     "mota": "testua",
     "html": "<strong>Ejemplo 46:</strong> <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></math>. Notación matricial: <math display=\"block\"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mi>−</mi><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mi>y</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mi>y</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mi>A</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mi>B</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><msup><mi>X</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>X</mi><mi>.</mi></mrow></math> <math display=\"inline\"><mi>λ</mi></math> = <strong>valores propios</strong> de <math display=\"inline\"><mi>A</mi></math>. Polinomio característico: <math display=\"block\"><mrow><msub><mi>χ</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mi>−</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>−</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></math> <math display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>−</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>±</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>−</mi><mn>3</mn><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">erreal desberdinak</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></math>"
