     "html": "<strong><math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></math>:</strong> <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mi>−</mi><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mi>−</mi><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mi>A</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mi>B</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></math>, luego <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></math>. <strong><math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>−</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></math>:</strong> <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mi>A</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mi>B</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>−</mi><mn>4</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></math>, luego <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mi>−</mi><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>−</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></math>."
